# W4i, a (k5): takes the gate at @80 with nothing running and hosts a Public instance (its remembered default) in stag0101; it
# plays there (players at b's arrival stage) when b arrives about 20 s later, so a's instance runs (no longer starting). It plays
# alone (b never arrives in its stage group).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=2400 fail present>=2
log a alone
idle until frames>=60
